WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.789
Download the complete v2 ZIP and extract it

00:00:04.789 --> 00:00:09.578
Open the Original folder

00:00:09.578 --> 00:00:14.367
Keep one untouched copy, then duplicate the files you will edit

00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:19.156
Use Word or a compatible editor for DOCX and Excel or a compatible spreadsheet app for XLSX.

00:00:19.156 --> 00:00:26.625
Open 01_WhatsApp_50_Templates.docx and choose template 06 under price and availability

00:00:26.625 --> 00:00:34.093
Replace the product, price, colour and sizes with facts you have checked

00:00:34.093 --> 00:00:41.562
If a fact is unknown, ask for clarification instead of filling it with an AI guess.

00:00:41.562 --> 00:00:49.404
For the fictional Cedar Boutique, the reply becomes: The linen shirt is 25 US dollars and is available in blue, sizes medium and large

00:00:49.404 --> 00:00:57.246
Would you like the size measurements? This example is a draft

00:00:57.246 --> 00:01:05.087
Verify stock, delivery fees and store policy before sending your own version.

00:01:05.087 --> 00:01:10.804
Open 04_Customer_Tracker.xlsx

00:01:10.804 --> 00:01:16.520
In Leads, replace the demo rows with your own permitted data

00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:22.236
Enter an ID, date, channel, item of interest, status and next follow-up date

00:01:22.236 --> 00:01:27.952
Leave optional contact information blank unless needed

00:01:27.952 --> 00:01:33.668
Use Orders for confirmed orders; never count an inquiry as a sale.

00:01:33.668 --> 00:01:39.317
Choose one idea from 02_Instagram_30_Posts.docx

00:01:39.317 --> 00:01:44.966
Open 03_AI_Prompts_12.docx if you want help drafting

00:01:44.966 --> 00:01:50.615
Give the AI only approved product facts and anonymous context

00:01:50.615 --> 00:01:56.264
Ask it to flag missing information

00:01:56.264 --> 00:02:01.913
Review every claim and replace every placeholder before use.

00:02:01.913 --> 00:02:06.945
Save your edited documents and workbook in a dated folder

00:02:06.945 --> 00:02:11.977
Check that prices and totals match your current offer

00:02:11.977 --> 00:02:17.009
Follow up only when appropriate and with required consent

00:02:17.009 --> 00:02:22.041
The original messaging examples are Arabic; this English tutorial does not translate all templates

00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:27.073
For help, use the support address in the guide.

